flowchart LR
  Prepare["Prepare: authority, inventory, contacts, playbooks and exercises"]
  Detect["Detect and validate"]
  Classify["Classify severity, scope and legal contexts"]
  Contain["Contain with least blast radius and preserve evidence"]
  Investigate["Investigate timeline, root cause and impact"]
  Eradicate["Eradicate persistence and revoke compromised trust"]
  Recover["Recover cleanly and reconcile fiscal, tenant and audit integrity"]
  Notify["Execute approved notifications and communications"]
  Review["Review, remediate, test and improve"]

  Prepare --> Detect
  Detect --> Classify
  Classify --> Contain
  Contain --> Investigate
  Investigate --> Eradicate
  Eradicate --> Recover
  Classify --> Notify
  Recover --> Notify
  Notify --> Review
  Review --> Prepare
